<code>assert index >= 0 && index < \old(this.size()) => \forall int i; index < i && i < \old(this.size()); (this.get(i) == null) == (\old(this.get(i)) == null) && (this.get(i) != null) => this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i)));</code>

This assert statement ensures that for every position greater than the given index and within the original size of the vector, the element at that position remains unchanged if it was not null before the operation, and if it was null before, it remains null after the operation.
